WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
A night highway run.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.000
The driver's eyes start to close.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The cab alert sounds.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
The safety team sees it live.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:28.200
The driver is coached the next morning.
